MINION 3
#TEST SOLCOUNT 0
# Regression: litsumgeq with one variable in two literal positions needing
# different values. x cannot equal both 4 and 2, so the count is < 2 always;
# the watched-literal force-assign used to satisfy only one literal and
# wrongly report x=4 as a solution.
**VARIABLES**
DISCRETE x {0..5}
**SEARCH**
PRINT[[x]]
**CONSTRAINTS**
litsumgeq([x, x], [4, 2], 2)
**EOF**
